OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding 'could stop an ambulance
OL,4,Areaching me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly resident who has had four
OL,7,Fheart attacks in two years says he is
OL,8,Fworried ambulance staff "won't be able"
OL,9,Fto get him out of his house in an
OL,10,Femergency because water floods right up
OL,11,Fto his front door after heavy rainfall.
OL,13,FBrian Reynolds, 78, has lived on Gipsy
OL,14,FLane in Gorse Hill, Swindon for 31
OL,15,Fyears and said the drains had
OL,16,F"persistently" flooded since he moved
OL,17,Fthere.
OL,19,F"I am so fed up. Enough's enough. They
OL,20,Fdon't understand the stress I am
OL,21,Funder," the pensioner said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
