OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding 'could stop an ambulance
OL,4,Areaching me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJake Chandler, Swindon Borough Council
OL,7,Fcabinet member responsible for
OL,8,Fflooding, said the authority had
OL,9,Flaunched a "full flooding
OL,10,Finvestigation" and structural works
OL,11,Fwould take place within six months.
